===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=impf}}

# to [[think]] {{gloss|to reckon, to estimate}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslím''', [[že]] [[to]] [[zvládnout|zvládneš]].|I '''think''' you're going to make it.}}
