# to [[mean]]
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslel''' [[jsem]] [[to]] [[metaforický|metaforicky]].|I '''meant''' it metaphorically.}}
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-si}} to [[think]], to [[guess]], to [[suppose]]

